<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>A Message For You ❤️</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      max-width: 500px;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    h1 {
      color: #e75480;
    }

    p {
      color: #444;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .heart {
      font-size: 55px;
      animation: beat 1s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes beat {
      50% {
        transform: scale(1.2);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="heart">❤️</div>

    <h1>Can We Try Again?</h1>

    <p>
      can we try again, pleaseee pleaseee
      I'm begging you.
    </p>

    <p>
      I miss you so much.
      Every single day feels empty without you.
    </p>

    <p>
      I know I wasn't perfect, and I know I made mistakes,
      but I truly hope we can talk and try to make things better.
    </p>

    <p>
      ❤️
    </p>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
